desktop: card="The Canyon Works" visible=true statesPurse=true consoleErrors=0
  - Sentry Beacons raised on marked PYLON SITES carry current up the switchbacks.
  - The Works keeps a strongbox: this claim's purse holds 360 gold, not the usual 200, so all six beacons (25+35+45+55+75+95 = 330) fit in one descent.
  - Every gallery, lamp, turret, and tram draws watts; the ledger sheds higher-priority numbers first.
  - Fevered saboteurs are drawn to the grid and cut a span when they wreck a pylon.
